# =============================================================================
# Direct production dependencies for the backend.
#
# This file is the source of truth for production deps. Edit this, then run
# `make lock-backend` from the repo root to regenerate the hashed
# `requirements.txt` lockfile via `pip-compile --generate-hashes`.
#
# Never edit requirements.txt by hand — it is generated and hash-pinned.
# =============================================================================

